<%- include('dash-header') %><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">A LITTLE VISIBILITY</p><h1>The energy behind the thought.</h1><p class="heading-description">Reasoning and background work, measured in tokens. Your last 30 days.</p></div></div><div class="stats-grid three"><article class="stat-card"><div><span>Total tokens</span><i class="stat-symbol lime-text">▥</i></div><strong><%= formatNumber(totals.input+totals.output) %></strong><p>Across recorded models</p></article><article class="stat-card"><div><span>Read & considered</span></div><strong><%= formatNumber(totals.input) %></strong><p>Input tokens</p></article><article class="stat-card"><div><span>Written & returned</span></div><strong><%= formatNumber(totals.output) %></strong><p>Output tokens</p></article></div><section class="dash-panel usage-table-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="overline">DAILY ALLOWANCE</p><h2><%= formatNumber(dailyBudget) %> tokens per brain</h2></div><span class="tiny-pill">RESETS DAILY · PACIFIC</span></div><% if(!rows.length) { %><div class="quiet-empty"><span>▥</span><p>No thinking usage recorded yet. It will appear here when Brain starts reasoning or working on a task.</p></div><% } else { %><div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Usage history"><table class="usage-table"><caption class="sr-only">Recorded usage by date and model</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Model</th><th scope="col">Input</th><th scope="col">Output</th><th scope="col">Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><% rows.forEach(row=>{ %><tr><td><%= row.local_date %></td><td><%= row.model %></td><td><%= formatNumber(row.input_tokens) %></td><td><%= formatNumber(row.output_tokens) %></td><td><%= formatNumber(Number(row.input_tokens)+Number(row.output_tokens)) %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% } %><p class="usage-safeguard">Thinking also shares a service-wide daily safeguard. It can pause before this brain’s own allowance is used.</p></section><%- include('dash-footer') %>
